      "pinyin": "dāng rán zhè xiē hěn duō dōu shì piàn rén de",
      "english": "Medicine xx, guaranteed to cure all diseases! Medicine xx, specially treats hard to cure diseases!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Of course, a lot of these are scams."
    },
    {
