    "sentence_translations": [
      "Guaranteed to Cure All Diseases",
      "",
      "On the walls and pillars in a lot of areas in China you can find small ads saying:",
      "Medicine xx, guaranteed to cure all diseases! Medicine xx, specially treats hard to cure diseases!",
      "Of course, a lot of these are scams.",
      "",
      "One day, Li Li said to Zhang Ming: “Darling, I'm sick!”",
      "",
      "Zhang Ming: “If you're sick, let's go to the hospital.”",
      "",
      "Li Li: “Why don't you buy a bag for me. If you buy a bag I will get well!”",
      "",
      "Zhang Ming: “How would buying a bag help you when you're sick?”",
      "",
      "Li Li laughed and said: “Don't you know? ‘Bags cure all diseases’. It says so on all the walls outside.”",
      "",
      "Zhang Ming thought for a bit and said: “Wait here.”",
      "A few minutes later, Zhang Ming came back holding a brick.",
      "",
      "Li Li jumped from surprise and asked: “What are you doing bringing a brick home?”",
      "",
      "Zhang Ming answered: “I'm going to show you why they say ‘bricks treat hard to cure diseases’!”"
    ]
  }
